# Cloudflare Pages _headers — security headers applied at the edge.
# The main security defense for code execution is the sandboxed iframe in
# ExecutionSandbox.tsx (sandbox="allow-scripts" with no allow-same-origin,
# opaque origin). These headers are defense-in-depth.
#
# connect-src uses https://*.google-analytics.com rather than the bare
# www.google-analytics.com host: GA4 routes some regions (notably the EU, a core
# ABAP market) to region1.google-analytics.com, and a bare host would block
# those beacons silently — no console error the user would report, just missing
# data for those users.
#
# static.cloudflareinsights.com / cloudflareinsights.com are Cloudflare Web
# Analytics, which the edge injects into every HTML response because the site
# has it enabled. Leaving it out of the CSP did not disable it — it broke it,
# loudly: a violation in every visitor's console on every page load, and zero
# data collected. For a developer tool, a console full of our own CSP errors is
# a bad first impression, and this audience blocks GA4 at a far higher rate than
# most, so the two together are the only way to see how much GA4 misses.
#
# Checked before allowing it, then again against real traffic. The script reads
# location.protocol, host and pathname and never .href, .hash, .search or
# document.URL; loading abapdojo.com/#code=<source> and capturing the POST it
# makes shows {"location":"https://abapdojo.com/","referrer":""} — origin and
# pathname only. That is the same bar index.html's explicit page_location holds
# GA4 to. Re-check if the version in the injected data-cf-beacon tag changes.
#
# That POST goes to the site's OWN origin, /cdn-cgi/rum, which 'self' already
# covers — so connect-src https://cloudflareinsights.com is not what makes the
# beacon work today. It is the fallback the script uses when the site is not
# proxied through Cloudflare, i.e. the *.pages.dev case that also silently
# disables gtag (see CLAUDE.md, Analytics). Kept so measurement survives that,
# not because the current setup needs it.

/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), camera=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), magnetometer=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' 'unsafe-eval' https://www.googletagmanager.com https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: https:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://*.google-analytics.com https://*.analytics.google.com https://*.googletagmanager.com https://cloudflareinsights.com; worker-src 'self' blob:; frame-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
